# READING THIS AS A CLOSURE: `bend` stops at the FIRST error per file, so
# each Location is the FIRST still-unfixed site. A site is CLOSED iff adding
# a constructor breaks it, and each Location above is such a site -- but a
# file listing ZERO locations in a later round is only evidence of open-ness
# for the sites the earlier rounds already fixed.
